---
// Editorial copy reviewed in October 2026; keep factual claims aligned with current services.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Website Privacy Policy | Immigrant Resource Center"
  description="Learn how Immigrant Resource Center handles website inquiries, email delivery, spam protection, and analytics, and how to contact us about privacy."
  canonical="https://ircoffice.com/privacy"
>
  <section style="padding-top: 8rem; padding-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h1 class="contact-information__heading align-middle my-10">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="divider__contact"></div>
    <p class="paragraph-section align-middle my-30 max-width-600">
      Last updated: October 2026. This policy explains what information this website collects and
      how it is used. It describes the website only; it is not a description of our full client
      intake process.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h2 class="heading__section align-middle my-15">Information we collect</h2>
    <p class="paragraph-section my-20 max-width-600">
      When you submit a contact form, we receive the <strong>name, email address, phone number, and message</strong> you provide so we can respond to your inquiry. Please keep your first message brief and leave out sensitive identity or case documents.
    </p>
    <p class="paragraph-section my-20 max-width-600">
      We do not sell, rent, or share this information with third parties for their marketing, and we
      only share it with the service providers who help us operate the site and receive your message
      (described below).
    </p>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h2 class="heading__section align-middle my-15">How your message reaches us</h2>
    <p class="paragraph-section my-20 max-width-600">
      We use <strong>Resend</strong> to deliver form submissions by email and <strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong> to help detect automated spam. Cloudflare also hosts the site. These services process information needed for delivery, hosting, and security under their own policies.
    </p>
  </section>


  <section style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h2 class="heading__section align-middle my-15">Technical information and external services</h2>
    <p class="paragraph-section my-20 max-width-600">
      To limit spam, we count repeated form submissions from the same IP address. This counter
      expires one hour after the most recent counted request. Error logs may include an IP address
      and technical details about a failed submission. These records help us investigate delivery
      and security issues.
    </p>
    <p class="paragraph-section my-20 max-width-600">
      Pages request fonts from Google Fonts, and pages with maps request map tiles from
      OpenStreetMap. Loading these resources sends technical request information, such as your IP
      address, to the provider. Links to external websites are governed by those sites' policies.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h2 class="heading__section align-middle my-15">Analytics</h2>
    <p class="paragraph-section my-20 max-width-600">
      When enabled, <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> helps us understand aggregate page usage. Cloudflare describes this service as cookie-free analytics that does not track visitors across websites.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h2 class="heading__section align-middle my-15">Cookies</h2>
    <p class="paragraph-section my-20 max-width-600">
      This website does <strong>not</strong> set advertising or cross-site tracking cookies. Any
      storage used is limited to what is strictly necessary for the site and its spam protection
      to function.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h2 class="heading__section align-middle my-15">Your choices</h2>
    <p class="paragraph-section my-20 max-width-600">
      Contact us to ask about information you submitted or to request deletion. Messages are
      delivered by email, and related technical records may also be held by service providers. We
      can explain what we can remove and any limits that apply to your request.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h2 class="heading__section align-middle my-15">How to reach us about privacy</h2>
    <p class="paragraph-section my-20 max-width-600">
      If you have any questions about this policy or about information you have shared with us,
      contact us using the form on our <a href="/contact" class="tab-text-link">Contact page</a>,
      or reach us directly at:
    </p>
    <ul class="green-card green-card--list my-35">
      <li><strong>Phone:</strong> (612) 822-5747</li>
      <li><strong>Address:</strong> 1 W Lake St Ste #165, Minneapolis, MN 55408</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!--section important notice (verbatim, legally load-bearing; deliberate reinforcement of the
      Footer's global Disclaimer, not a duplication to remove)-->
  <section style="padding-bottom: 10rem;">
    <h2 class="heading__section align-middle my-15">Important notice</h2>
    <p class="paragraph-section my-20 max-width-600">
      Immigrant Resource Center is a private entity that is registered in Minnesota and provides
      professional immigration and travel services at your direction. We are not a law firm or a
      substitute for an attorney or law firm, and we are not affiliated with USCIS or any government
      agency. We do not provide legal advice.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
